{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, approach it, take it if reachable, process it, move to location and complete task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CompleteTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsAtDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
    "BT": {
